Package: cix-gpu-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: libmali-cix
Description: Arm Mali kbase kernel driver for the CIX P1 GPU (DKMS)
 Builds mali_kbase.ko (with memory_group_manager and protected_memory_allocator),
 the Arm Mali "kbase" kernel driver for the Mali-G720-Immortalis (CSF) GPU of
 the CIX P1 / CD8180, at DDK release r54p1 to match libmali. CIX's driver,
 ported to mainline ARM64 7.x kernels, with ACE-Lite coherency from the ACPI
 _CCA of the GPU device.
 .
 DKMS builds the module for each installed kernel with CONFIG_ARCH_CIX and its
 headers. It provides /dev/mali0 for libmali-cix in place of the in-tree
 panthor driver; "mali-switch" (libmali-cix) chooses between the two.
